WEBVTT

00:03.450 --> 00:06.010
How could you ever understand how I feel?

00:08.420 --> 00:13.710
Because I want to know... even if it's just a little bit.

00:15.130 --> 00:16.070
That's why...

00:16.070 --> 00:17.120
I...

00:17.120 --> 00:19.030
You hate magic!

00:19.030 --> 00:20.180
Shut up!

00:20.610 --> 00:22.040
You want to cry, more than anybody!

00:22.040 --> 00:22.830
Shut up!

00:22.960 --> 00:23.620
Shut up!

00:23.910 --> 00:24.460
Shut up!

00:24.580 --> 00:25.120
Shut up!

00:25.290 --> 00:25.960
Shut up!

00:26.170 --> 00:26.710
Shut up!

00:27.080 --> 00:27.920
Shut up!

00:28.130 --> 00:28.790
Shut up!

00:30.280 --> 00:31.260
Shut up...

00:38.480 --> 00:40.960
I'm glad that you're all right.

00:44.550 --> 00:45.750
You're still alive.

00:47.030 --> 00:49.390
I'm really glad...

00:54.970 --> 00:56.070
Ah, I see.

00:56.630 --> 00:58.530
Thank you so much, Gouta-kun.

01:00.000 --> 01:02.540
Yes, I will be coming back soon.

01:03.150 --> 01:05.030
Thank goodness.

01:10.050 --> 01:11.020
I see.

01:11.290 --> 01:14.000
That Gouta... he actually found Sora-chan.

01:15.220 --> 01:18.510
So he still used magic even though he knew he'd be punished.

01:28.340 --> 01:29.890
Everyone's relieved.

01:30.760 --> 01:31.590
Gouta...

01:33.190 --> 01:33.880
Hmm?

01:34.580 --> 01:35.570
Thank you.

01:38.410 --> 01:39.290
Gouta.

01:39.780 --> 01:40.460
Hmm?

01:41.220 --> 01:41.980
Gouta.

01:43.860 --> 01:44.730
Gouta.

03:43.630 --> 03:45.280
The fish is done grilling.

03:45.950 --> 03:47.520
What a nice morning it is today.

03:52.330 --> 03:53.500
Oh, it's delicious.

03:53.500 --> 03:55.960
Although it's the same salmon, it has a completely different taste.

03:56.250 --> 03:56.960
Yes.

03:57.290 --> 03:58.880
Just leave the fish to me.

04:01.200 --> 04:03.740
Wow, the miso soup is also great.

04:04.120 --> 04:05.800
Miso soup just isn't the same...

04:05.800 --> 04:07.980
without tofu and mushrooms!

04:12.300 --> 04:14.140
We'll be heading out now.

04:14.140 --> 04:15.870
Yes, keep up the good work.

04:17.560 --> 04:18.980
We're off!

04:18.980 --> 04:21.490
All right, come back soon.

04:21.490 --> 04:22.270
Okay!

04:23.860 --> 04:26.700
Well, I...

04:27.160 --> 04:28.910
You'll be fine.

04:28.910 --> 04:30.830
Now go on.

04:30.830 --> 04:32.880
Okay, I'll be going.

04:33.870 --> 04:34.640
I'm...

04:36.090 --> 04:37.670
really thankful for everything.

04:40.300 --> 04:42.630
Sorry for causing so many problems.

04:42.630 --> 04:43.740
It's fine.

04:44.310 --> 04:46.720
Kuroda-kun, you've been working hard.

04:47.510 --> 04:48.790
Thank you very much.

04:49.180 --> 04:50.090
Kuroda-kun.

04:53.260 --> 04:57.400
Hey, you're going to be late.

04:57.400 --> 04:59.990
Okay! I'll be leaving soon!

05:07.200 --> 05:09.990
Now then, we will begin the exam.

05:09.990 --> 05:11.620
You have 50 minutes.

05:11.620 --> 05:16.630
The test will cover everything you've learned up to now about magic: physics, chemistry and history,

05:17.170 --> 05:19.670
as well as questions from the practical application.

05:20.590 --> 05:22.790
Please turn over your exams.

05:25.310 --> 05:26.470
Wow!

05:27.230 --> 05:29.260
This is going to be easy!

05:29.260 --> 05:31.890
Oohata-kun, be quiet during the exam!

05:31.890 --> 05:34.370
Yes, I'm sorry.

06:02.210 --> 06:03.800
Okay, 30 minutes left.

06:03.800 --> 06:06.660
What?

06:09.870 --> 06:12.190
A month has passed by so quickly.

06:13.360 --> 06:16.840
I'm glad that Sora-chan is doing fine today.

06:18.410 --> 06:19.710
Her adolescence...

06:22.210 --> 06:24.820
Her adolescence is bright.

06:24.820 --> 06:25.720
That's true.

06:26.790 --> 06:27.780
Saori-chan.

06:28.760 --> 06:31.090
I guess my smile earlier was a little forced.

06:32.960 --> 06:34.740
Shouldn't you be calling me "Saori-obasan"?

06:48.490 --> 06:51.260
Midorikawa-kun, you've worked really hard.

06:51.740 --> 06:52.920
Thank you.

06:53.750 --> 06:55.870
Now that your magic has awakened, you can do anything.

06:56.490 --> 06:58.880
You could even take on the world!

06:59.410 --> 07:00.890
Is that the bicycle...?

07:00.890 --> 07:03.100
Can I cry?

07:03.100 --> 07:03.870
What?

07:04.240 --> 07:07.360
I think... I'm gonna cry at the graduation ceremony.

07:07.700 --> 07:10.150
No, I think I'll cry now.

07:10.740 --> 07:16.780
Even though I want to cry... I can't do it here...

07:12.370 --> 07:14.950
Morishita is really weird.

07:14.950 --> 07:15.810
Yeah.

07:29.630 --> 07:31.010
Drills made by the heavens!

07:31.010 --> 07:32.270
All right.

07:38.270 --> 07:40.180
Wow! That's cute!

07:40.180 --> 07:41.480
Thank you.

07:41.890 --> 07:43.050
Sora-chan, how about yours?

07:44.100 --> 07:44.940
Over there.

07:45.540 --> 07:47.440
Oh, it's beautiful!

07:47.440 --> 07:48.820
It looks like they are dancing.

07:49.660 --> 07:52.530
Gouta-kun's ice is like the waves for surfing.

07:52.530 --> 07:56.310
Hey, and mine, it's more effective than before...

07:55.520 --> 07:56.820
I've lost.

07:56.820 --> 07:59.120
Sora-chan's magic is really something.

07:59.120 --> 08:01.590
There is no winning or losing in magic.

08:02.170 --> 08:04.100
Asagi's ice crystals are beautiful too.

08:04.730 --> 08:05.510
Stupid!

08:10.000 --> 08:12.970
I will now announce the test results.

08:12.970 --> 08:16.510
To sum up the results of the theoretical test and the practical test,

08:16.510 --> 08:20.750
all twenty trainees of this term have passed the test!

08:23.540 --> 08:25.270
Congratulations, Midorikawa-kun.

08:25.270 --> 08:26.160
You too.

08:27.720 --> 08:30.180
I really... passed...

08:32.570 --> 08:34.150
The graduation ceremony will be at 13:00.

08:34.750 --> 08:36.270
The location will be this classroom.

08:38.120 --> 08:40.030
Don't be late, everybody.

08:40.030 --> 08:41.520
Okay!

08:41.980 --> 08:46.420
Mom, I've become a mage.

08:54.800 --> 08:57.410
I will now hand out the official mage certificates.

08:58.730 --> 08:59.960
Asagi Honomi.

09:00.580 --> 09:01.300
Yes.

09:07.900 --> 09:13.420
Asagi Honomi-dono has successfully completed all the courses required for mages.

09:14.280 --> 09:16.720
We now award her the certification of an official mage,

09:17.100 --> 09:20.920
on behalf of the Magical Labor Department, Minister Takada Keiji.

09:27.290 --> 09:29.350
You've received an excellent result.

09:29.710 --> 09:34.940
From now on, please don't be too confident of your own powers, and answer to your client's expectations.

09:35.560 --> 09:37.700
Yes, I will keep that in mind.

09:43.510 --> 09:44.440
Hono-chan...

09:48.020 --> 09:49.140
Kuroda Koji.

09:49.620 --> 09:50.310
Yes.

09:54.660 --> 09:55.860
Kuroda Koji-dono.

09:56.340 --> 09:57.520
The same applies to you.

09:59.160 --> 10:00.550
What? Why?

10:01.040 --> 10:03.520
Kuroda-kun, your class attendance record is insufficent.

10:04.110 --> 10:05.380
You haven't forgetten, right?

10:06.030 --> 10:06.960
No.

10:07.600 --> 10:11.970
So we'll hold the certificate until next week, when you have made up the missed lesson.

10:12.310 --> 10:15.130
You can contact Todoroki-san for details.

10:15.130 --> 10:17.840
Yes, thank you very much.

10:17.840 --> 10:19.300
Susumi Asako.

10:19.300 --> 10:20.090
Yes.

10:23.260 --> 10:26.560
Everyone was so nice to me.

10:27.210 --> 10:28.580
This is...

10:30.570 --> 10:33.850
the happiest day of my life!

10:34.220 --> 10:35.490
Thank you!

10:43.210 --> 10:43.930
Yes.

10:45.000 --> 10:47.240
I will do my best from now on.

10:58.900 --> 11:00.550
Ah... thank you...

11:02.700 --> 11:03.450
Yeah!

11:08.800 --> 11:10.060
Now, now.

11:10.060 --> 11:12.850
It's a real embarrassment for a man to cry this much.

11:12.850 --> 11:13.660
But...

11:14.070 --> 11:14.770
I...

11:15.070 --> 11:15.770
I...

11:16.080 --> 11:16.890
Everyone...

11:18.420 --> 11:19.310
Congratulations.

11:23.140 --> 11:24.520
Motohashi-san.

11:29.470 --> 11:30.270
Dad...

11:33.840 --> 11:35.000
Mother...

11:35.000 --> 11:36.590
Midorikawa Gouta.

11:36.590 --> 11:37.300
Yes!

11:42.760 --> 11:44.150
Midorikawa Gouta-dono.

11:44.650 --> 11:45.520
The same for you.

11:46.340 --> 11:47.550
Thank you very much.

11:49.360 --> 11:51.430
You've really worked hard.

11:51.430 --> 11:56.810
Although you have had so many hardships, you never gave up and succeeded.

11:57.660 --> 11:58.940
Congratulations on passing the exam.

11:58.940 --> 11:59.760
Thanks.

12:00.330 --> 12:02.680
Midorikawa-kun, you worked hard.

12:03.690 --> 12:08.200
I've taught for over 25 years and this is the first time I've been so moved.

12:08.200 --> 12:08.880
Thank you.

12:09.300 --> 12:10.070
Thank you.

12:14.500 --> 12:16.040
Yamabuki Hiyori.

12:16.040 --> 12:16.810
Yes.

12:22.070 --> 12:23.510
Yamabuki Hiyori-dono.

12:24.170 --> 12:25.060
The same for you.

12:27.060 --> 12:29.970
Your magic abilities still have a lot of potential.

12:29.970 --> 12:30.950
Yes.

12:31.300 --> 12:35.690
Please don't forget your kindness and become a wonderful mage.

12:35.690 --> 12:36.650
Okay.

12:37.960 --> 12:38.830
When I...

12:40.060 --> 12:41.590
When I return to Nagasaki,

12:42.500 --> 12:45.030
I'll always remember this place and do my best.

12:49.800 --> 12:50.780
Suzuki Sora.

12:51.490 --> 12:52.210
Yes.

12:58.450 --> 12:59.710
Suzuki Sora-dono.

13:00.030 --> 13:00.930
The same for you.

13:04.840 --> 13:06.210
Thanks, Sora-san.

13:07.790 --> 13:12.210
Because of you, Suzuki-san, we all have gained a lot courage.

13:12.720 --> 13:13.540
Yes.

13:14.110 --> 13:16.510
Congratulations on becoming an official mage.

13:17.100 --> 13:18.500
Thank you very much.

13:27.430 --> 13:29.250
Congratulations, Sora-chan!

13:30.750 --> 13:31.950
That's great, right?

13:32.450 --> 13:33.570
Congratulations!

13:39.720 --> 13:45.640
For all the mages here, today is not the end, but the real beginning.

13:46.140 --> 13:50.960
From now on, in life, there will be many hardships and pains.

13:51.470 --> 13:54.020
But I urge you to never give up.

13:54.680 --> 13:56.760
You are not alone.

13:58.070 --> 14:00.230
You all now have many comrades.

14:00.230 --> 14:03.860
If you can't overcome it by yourself, then overcome it together!

14:03.860 --> 14:04.700
Yes!

14:07.350 --> 14:11.320
I too, am now considered your 21st comrade.

14:11.320 --> 14:14.550
At any time, you can talk to me in the Bureau of Magic about anything.

14:14.960 --> 14:17.680
We will always be there for you.

14:21.770 --> 14:25.630
I didn't think that you'd come and attend the graduation ceremony.

14:25.630 --> 14:28.090
Sora-chan, you've done well.

14:28.580 --> 14:30.760
I see Motohashi-san is doing well too.

14:30.760 --> 14:32.640
That's all thanks to you.

14:33.340 --> 14:36.390
I'm going to visit my daughter's place tomorrow.

14:36.390 --> 14:38.060
In England?

14:38.060 --> 14:41.640
Yes, I wanted to tell you about this.

14:43.550 --> 14:46.500
I'm going to meet Peter Rabbit.

14:50.390 --> 14:51.660
I was surprised.

14:51.660 --> 14:53.310
Both of you came together.

14:53.800 --> 14:56.620
That's because we wanted to see Gouta shine!

14:56.620 --> 14:58.060
You did well.

14:58.680 --> 15:00.830
Mom, does that mean you're coming home?

15:02.950 --> 15:06.790
Your dad can't see the future if I'm not with him.

15:06.790 --> 15:07.490
Right?

15:10.170 --> 15:13.160
There is someone I want to introduce to you.

15:14.140 --> 15:14.930
Sora!

15:15.280 --> 15:16.050
Sora!

15:16.960 --> 15:18.820
He's introducing someone to us!

15:20.450 --> 15:21.480
Um...

15:23.560 --> 15:24.900
Pleased to meet you.

15:24.900 --> 15:26.380
I'm Suzuki Sora.

15:27.430 --> 15:32.530
If Sora was not here, I might not have been able to become a mage.

15:34.340 --> 15:36.120
Thank you for taking care of Gouta.

15:36.120 --> 15:38.080
Thank you, Sora-san.

15:42.500 --> 15:44.000
It's over.

15:44.000 --> 15:44.880
Yeah.

15:44.880 --> 15:48.410
I'm glad that everyone could graduate together.

15:48.900 --> 15:49.720
Everyone...

15:50.130 --> 15:52.590
Hiyo-chan, Hono-chan... thank you.

15:52.590 --> 15:54.900
And also Kuroda-kun and Gouta-kun.

15:55.660 --> 15:57.760
What's with that all of a sudden, Suzuki Sora?

15:58.300 --> 16:02.190
Besides, Kuroda Koji still hasn't graduated yet.

16:02.810 --> 16:05.270
Shut up, Asagi.

16:05.270 --> 16:08.480
Kuroda-kun just has low attendance.

16:08.480 --> 16:10.720
I know about that.

16:11.160 --> 16:14.370
Yamabuki Hiyori's consolation also doesn't work here...

16:14.770 --> 16:15.700
I...

16:16.610 --> 16:18.450
I want to go play in Hokkaido!

16:18.450 --> 16:19.270
Okay.

16:19.550 --> 16:21.160
I'll come visit you too.

16:21.160 --> 16:22.850
Midorikawa's coming too, right?

16:23.340 --> 16:24.080
Yeah.

16:26.350 --> 16:27.580
How about you, Kuroda Koji?

16:27.580 --> 16:28.290
Huh?

16:28.290 --> 16:29.080
With you, Asagi?

16:29.460 --> 16:30.550
Idiot!

16:30.550 --> 16:31.960
I meant with everyone!

16:31.960 --> 16:33.180
Ah, I see.

16:34.250 --> 16:36.930
But you're acting all high and mighty again.

16:41.850 --> 16:43.040
Bye, then.

16:43.700 --> 16:44.730
I will call you later.

16:44.730 --> 16:45.800
Okay.

16:46.370 --> 16:47.260
You know...

16:47.960 --> 16:50.110
I thought a lot about yesterday.

16:50.110 --> 16:50.900
Yes.

16:51.520 --> 16:55.640
And, I have decided to ask you to forget about me.

16:57.430 --> 17:00.490
But I know that isn't what I actually want.

17:03.320 --> 17:06.240
Please don't forget about me.

17:08.770 --> 17:12.380
You can even marry and have lots of children...

17:13.470 --> 17:16.400
but please remember me once in a while.

17:24.530 --> 17:25.230
Silly.

17:32.180 --> 17:33.190
Um...

17:33.190 --> 17:35.280
Oh, the girl with the long hair.

17:35.870 --> 17:36.700
Yes!

17:36.700 --> 17:39.460
We've both become mages.

17:39.930 --> 17:40.770
Really?

17:41.080 --> 17:42.050
That's wonderful.

17:42.410 --> 17:44.570
Thanks for your help that time.

17:45.450 --> 17:47.140
Today, you are together.

17:49.220 --> 17:51.970
Then I will sing a song for you two.

17:55.880 --> 17:56.790
It's called "Your Guitar."

18:33.120 --> 18:35.090
Congratulations, Sora-chan!

18:35.090 --> 18:36.720
Thank you.

18:37.080 --> 18:38.700
You've become a great mage.

18:39.410 --> 18:40.470
You too, Gouta-kun.

18:40.470 --> 18:42.030
I guess I'm an afterthought.

18:48.960 --> 18:49.940
Hara-sensei.

18:51.210 --> 18:53.310
I'm really grateful for everything.

18:55.130 --> 18:56.730
I'm just a bad teacher.

18:56.730 --> 18:57.600
What?

18:58.400 --> 19:01.230
You are the one who taught me many things.

19:01.700 --> 19:02.740
Why?

19:02.740 --> 19:04.100
It's not like that.

19:04.980 --> 19:09.700
Sora-chan, many clients will still remember you in their hearts.

19:09.700 --> 19:11.460
I always push myself...

19:11.460 --> 19:14.670
I thought you were only acting.

19:14.670 --> 19:16.430
It wasn't like that!

19:19.000 --> 19:22.340
I wish I had a daughter just like you.

19:22.340 --> 19:25.930
If that's what you think, you should get a wife first.

19:27.840 --> 19:28.780
You're right about that.

19:29.800 --> 19:33.590
Thanks to you, Hara-sensei, I've become a mage.

19:34.020 --> 19:35.650
It was by your own effort.

19:35.650 --> 19:39.530
Thank you for actually helping me.

19:39.530 --> 19:40.150
The same for you.

19:40.860 --> 19:43.270
I'm glad to have met you.

20:43.600 --> 20:45.340
Thank you for waiting.

20:45.340 --> 20:51.800
The Shinjuku train will be arriving on the second platform in 10 minutes.

20:52.140 --> 20:53.150
Gouta...

20:56.280 --> 20:57.160
Sora...

21:02.690 --> 21:05.930
Gouta-kun, breakfast is ready.

21:09.630 --> 21:11.020
Have you seen Gouta?

21:11.350 --> 21:13.410
He was here a while ago.

23:06.340 --> 23:09.250
I like Biei, the place where I grew up.

23:09.560 --> 23:13.750
The tomato juice and the milk from Mrs. Yoshiko... I love it!

23:14.530 --> 23:16.250
Next episode: Sora's Summer.

23:16.870 --> 23:19.520
Can you hear my voice?
